    "title": "Budget-three antipodal reverse-residual stratification",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "If q is the first nonzero centered outer coefficient of an antipodal quotient pencil and h=deg U-deg V, then the differential residual T=dDU-Y(D'U+4DU') is nonzero of exact degree deg U+4-qh. It contains every repeated, deleted-divisor, or zero root of U. On the two lowest official maximal-row strata T is respectively linear and quadratic.",
